- collision-hazard: this directory carries live filename-number collisions. `61` was RESOLVED 2026-08-17 (`61-fleet-console.lts` -> `76-fleet-console.lts`). TWO remain: `00-composer-design-principles.lts` with `00-composer-overview.lts`, and `46-console-sources-on-the-bus.lts` with `46-handover-process.lts` — both deliberately left, because their filenames are cited rather than merely described. Per [CXC-VISION-PLACEMENT] the numeric prefix is this corpus's ordering and cross-reference convention, so a collision is a real ambiguity git can never flag. 73 was verified free by listing.
- ratification-needed: whether a SERVICE spec belongs in a directory otherwise holding platform and widget specs, and whether `corpora/bus-storage/` should be revived as this document's home instead of de-registered. Both are the architect's.
